{
  "date": "2024-09-11",
  "messages": [
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "추천하고 싶은 노래가 있어",
      "en": "I have a song that I want to recommend."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "박재범 선배님의",
      "en": "It's by Jay Park sunbaenim."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "\"Stay With Me\"",
      "en": "\"Stay With Me.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "요즘 많이 듣는데",
      "en": "I've been listening to it a lot these days."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "들어봤는데",
      "en": "I listened to it,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "가사가 딱 내가 하고 싶은 말이야",
      "en": "and the lyrics are exactly what I want to say."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "빨리 들어봐",
      "en": "Hurry up and listen."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "이거 들으면 하연이도 내 옆에 있어주는 거야?",
      "en": "If I listen to it, will Hayeon be by my side too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "당연하지",
      "en": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "노래 너무 좋지",
      "en": "The song is so good, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그리고 갑자기 뜬금없지만",
      "en": "And even though this is out of the blue..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "며칠 전에",
      "en": "A few days ago,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아침에 학교 가고 있었는데",
      "en": "I was on my way to school in the morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "들을 노래가 뭐 있나 하다가",
      "en": "I was wondering what song I should listen to,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "우리 노래를 다 듣게 된 거야",
      "en": "so I ended up listening to all of our songs."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그러다가 \"hash\"를 틀었는데",
      "en": "Then I played \"hash,\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "갑자기 울었어",
      "en": "and I suddenly started crying."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "기분이 이상했어",
      "en": "It felt strange."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진짜 처음부터",
      "en": "Right from the beginning..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "\"투루루루루루\"",
      "en": "\"Tu-ru-ru-ru-ru-ru.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "\"랄랄라라라\"",
      "en": "\"La-la-la-la-la.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이 부분 나오자마자",
      "en": "As soon as that part came on..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "음...",
      "en": "Hmm..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "흥",
      "en": "*Sniff.*"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그렇게 됐어",
      "en": "That's what happened."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "요즘 하연이 진짜 감성적이네",
      "en": "Hayeon, you've been really emotional lately."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "사춘기인가",
      "en": "Maybe it's puberty."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아무튼",
      "en": "Anyway..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "신기해서",
      "en": "It just felt so interesting,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "말해주고 싶었어",
      "en": "so I wanted to tell you."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "힘든 건 아니지~~??",
      "en": "You're not having a hard time or anything, right~~??"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "딱히 그런 건 아니고",
      "en": "Not really."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그날 지하철을 탔거든!",
      "en": "I took the subway that day!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "예전의 하연이가 생각나더라",
      "en": "It reminded me of the Hayeon from back then."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "같은 지하철인데",
      "en": "It was the same subway,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 많이 달라졌구나",
      "en": "but I realized I've changed so much."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내 목소리가 들어간 일본 데뷔곡도 듣고",
      "en": "I even listened to our Japanese debut song with my voice in it."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "기분이 이상했어",
      "en": "It felt strange."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "예전에는",
      "en": "Back then..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아침 일찍 일어나서 지하철 타고",
      "en": "I'd wake up early in the morning, take the subway,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "연습실 가곤 했는데",
      "en": "and head to the practice room."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅠㅠㅠㅠㅠ",
      "en": "ㅠㅠㅠㅠㅠ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭐야 이 감성",
      "en": "What is this sentimental mood?"
    }
  ]
}